# 统一换行符：索引与工作区一律 LF，消除 Windows 下的 LF/CRLF 警告
# 说明：eol 属性的优先级高于 core.autocrlf，故无需修改 git 全局配置
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
